      "id": 11,
      "type": "subjective",
      "section": "Section D",
      "marks": 5,
      "question": "If $\\frac{a^n + b^n}{a^{n-1} + b^{n-1}}$ is the Arithmetic Mean between $a$ and $b$, then find the value of $n$.",
      "finalAnswer": "n = 1",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "$\\frac{a^n + b^n}{a^{n-1} + b^{n-1}} = \\frac{a+b}{2}$.",
        "$2a^n + 2b^n = a^n + ab^{n-1} + a^{n-1}b + b^n$.",
        "$a^n - a^{n-1}b = ab^{n-1} - b^n$.",
        "$a^{n-1}(a-b) = b^{n-1}(a-b)$.",
        "Since $a \\neq b$, $a^{n-1} = b^{n-1} \\implies (a/b)^{n-1} = 1 = (a/b)^0$.",
        "$n-1=0 \\implies n=1$."
      ]
    },
